<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JULY 25.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JULY 25.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Friday were as follows.</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:     July 25     July 24   Dec 31 96    CHANGE</p>
<p>								 FROM YR-END</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  286.600     285.750     247.020   16.02 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  309.300     309.380     306.830    0.81 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  156.280     156.205     158.970   -1.69 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.366	46.358	47.182   -1.73 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  477.400     478.640     419.180   13.89 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  138.750     138.700     141.685   -2.07 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.061	16.067	16.185   -0.77 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  246.700     247.200     212.430   16.13 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.854	 1.855	 1.888   -1.80 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.546	 1.549	 1.581   -2.21 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  189.290     192.300     183.135    3.36 %</p>
<p>Note: The net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
